{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手王嘉爾日前完成兩場杭州演唱會，他在社交網大派福利，分享演出背後的小花絮，其中一段影片是他在後台半裸除褲，期間不忘嘟嘴賣萌，雖然只是解開鈕扣露出少少內褲邊，但相信粉絲已睇到心如鹿撞。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;他又分享多段</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T16:13:53.208791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T16:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:08.061239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:08.061239+00:00","content_hash":"ee2c685f0984807dbe4e714815123da7d9d56d9b0b1573d70eed9b6a428048a0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}